	<ThingDef ParentName="TreeBase">
		<defName>Plant_TreeHarold</defName>
		<label>Harold tree</label>
		<description>This tree does not rustle in the wind. It moans.
The bark has tightened into the shape of a face — mouthless, but with two hollow pits for eyes. From deep inside the trunk comes a wet, gurgling sound. Someone is trying to form a word, but all that escapes is the creaking of branches rubbing against each other.
The branches tremble unnaturally — not from wind. From despair.
It hears you. It wants to ask for help. But all it can do is slowly rot standing up, staring into nothing, and remembering what it once was.</description>
		<!--  <thingClass>HarbingerTree</thingClass>-->
		<graphicData>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<texPath>Things/Plant/TreeHarold</texPath>
			<shadowData>
				<volume>(0.4, 0.3, 0.1)</volume>
				<offset>(0,0,-0.3)</offset>
			</shadowData>
		</graphicData>
		<minifiedDef IsNull="True"/>
